@startuml
 hide footbox
 skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

 participant "JMH benchmark\n(forked JVM)" as JMH
 participant k6
 participant Gateway
 participant Workflow
 participant "Pricing + order services\n(data lookups, simplified)" as Data
 participant "Risk service\n(service JVM)" as Risk

 == Microbenchmark: one timed invocation ==
 JMH -> JMH: **RiskScorer.evaluate(input, rules, implementation)**

 == Component benchmark: one timed HTTP request ==
 k6 -> Risk: POST /risk-evaluations
 Risk -> Risk: **RiskScorer.evaluate(input, rules, implementation)**
 Risk --> k6: Risk result

 == End-to-end benchmark: one timed gateway request ==
 k6 -> Gateway: POST /api/risk-previews
 Gateway -> Workflow: POST /risk-previews
 Workflow -> Data: Read prices, order history\nand customer profile
 Data --> Workflow: Quote data and profile
 Workflow -> Risk: POST /risk-evaluations
 Risk -> Risk: **RiskScorer.evaluate(input, rules, implementation)**
 Risk --> Workflow: Risk result
 Workflow --> Gateway: Quote + risk evaluation
 Gateway --> k6: Quote + risk evaluation

@enduml
